## Acceptance model

This card is NOT authorised to roll the budget into production.

Its job is to design and test the host-wide admission mechanism offline.

The required design must account for:

- dispatcher-launched parent workers;
- delegated child workers;
- local model-backed processes spawned through supported Hermes delegation paths;
- multi-board accounting;
