Do not copy this model into `~/.hermes/models/` merely because it loads.

Promotion requires explicit human sign-off after the completed report.

Required durable output remains:

- dated markdown report;
- machine-readable JSON;
- exact checkpoint identity;
- exact engine/version/commit;
- architecture;
- MTP tensor-status result;
- load/generation/tool/JSON/context metrics;
- MTP A/B or explicit reason it could not be performed;
- recommendation: PROMOTE / DO NOT PROMOTE / BASE ONLY / NEEDS FURTHER TEST.

